	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Dedicated pass(1) workflow. Keyword "pass" lists entries via scripts/list-pass.sh (copied from butler). Tab on a result to pick one of three actions: Enter/no-modifier copies the password (line 1) to the clipboard; Cmd copies the username (line 2) to the clipboard; Alt/Option runs `pass edit` inside a new kitty tab (targeting the most-recently-modified /tmp/kitty-* socket, falling back to opening a new kitty window) so any field beyond the first two lines can be copied by hand. Replaces butler's separate "pass" and "user" keywords with a single entry point.</string>
